==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is an [[Eyes of Forced Unconscious Sleep (Enemy Base)|Eyes of Forced Unconscious Sleep]].
*2 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 2~3.33 seconds<sup>60f~100f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*2 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 2~3.33 seconds<sup>60f~100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Enmu]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**2 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[Normal Cats]] to win.

